  "details": "Given that VRChat has a limit on the number of groups you can be in, if you're making heavy use of the group marketplace system, you might eventually be forced to leave a group you've purchased something in, in order to free up a slot for something else. Please clearly document what happens if you do so - or, ideally, make groups for which you have active purchased items not count to the limit.",
